# Beat 3, city: the road strip, the buildings arraying along it, the plan with the crosswalk stripes selected, the props, then the power poles and their wires.
stage city
clay on
wireframe off
view orbit
reveal buildings 0 0
reveal furniture 0 0
select road
wait 0.5
select buildings
reveal buildings 1 0.6
select road.crosswalks
view top
dolly 200 0.4
reveal furniture 1 0
select furniture
view orbit
orbit 15 0.4
reveal furniture 0.04 0
select furniture.poles
frame furniture.wires
orbit 15 0.3
